# guest: QNX 8.0.0, 4 processors

### 0. Stop running fs-9p instances; test files on the host: SLOW_SHARE/data.bin and SHARE/prio_demo/data.bin (2 MiB each)
fs-9p processes running: 0

### 1.a. fixed interrupt-thread priority (-f): pidin while a reader at priority 40 waits

qnx# fs-9p -d -v -f -a slow -m /mnt/slow
fs-9p 0.6.0: mount tag "slow" mounted at /mnt/slow (9P2000.L, msize 135168, legacy interface, interrupt-driven (interrupt thread priority 21, fixed), 16 request slots)

qnx# on -p 40 sh -c "dd if=/mnt/slow/data.bin bs=128k | md5sum" &   # a reader at priority 40
qnx# pidin -p dd; pidin -p fs-9p
